     3.1.1 sources and pre-built VAX/VMS binaries are available from host
uars.acd.ucar.edu in directory [.SRC.NETHACK] and from hamlet.caltech.edu
in [.NETHACK]. They are packaged in VMS-specific format and there is
a NETHACK.README file which describes the file format and unpacking
procedure; no extra archival or [de]compression utilities are necessary.
These are "official" binaries for VMS; the full sources are present but
are split into "useful" for VMS and "other" because the combined set is
so large.  Although the pre-built binares are for VAX/VMS, the source
package(s) can be directly unpacked and compiled under Alpha/VMS too.

